# The one rule for what counts as Penny's runtime (#3063): a commit touching
# any of these git pathspecs is deployed by the auto-deploy loop
# (scripts/deploy-loop.sh, `make prod-watch`) and announced in her `changelog`
# (scripts/store_git_info.sh → penny.changelog) — restarting happens exactly
# when the changelog announces, because both read this same file.
#
# One git pathspec per line; `#` starts a comment; blank lines are ignored.
# The prod container is built from ./penny (penny/Dockerfile) and mounts
# ./similarity and ./github_api read-only (docker-compose.yml), so those —
# with docker-compose.yml itself — are what Penny runs; everything else
# (browser/, penny-client/, docs/, scripts/, .github/, image_server/, the
# Makefile) isn't. The excludes drop penny's own test suite and Markdown from
# the penny/ include.
penny
:(exclude)penny/penny/tests/
:(exclude)*.md
similarity
github_api
docker-compose.yml
